TI  - Virtual Reality as a Tool for Wellbeing in Public Healthcare: Analysis of a Clinical Case
AU  - NUCCETELLI, FABIANA
AU  - GABELLONE, VALERIA
AU  - LOPALCO, PIER LUIGI
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/05/31
