TI  - Psychophysiological effects of low-frequency sound mediated by room size, room shape, and stimulus duration
AU  - Oomen, Paul
AU  - Geffen, Rona
AU  - Gentile, Daniela
AU  - Atassi, Nour
AU  - Farran, Bashar
AU  - Braun, Christoph
AU  - Villanueva, Veronica Cuevas
