TI  - Autonomic and psychophysiological effects of a 13-week mindfulness-based intervention in university students
AU  - Benítez-Agudelo, Juan Camilo
AU  - Navarro-Jiménez, Eduardo
AU  - Clemente-Suárez, Vicente Javier
