TI  - Physiological Entrainment: A Key Mind–Body Mechanism for Cognitive, Motor and Affective Functioning, and Well-Being
AU  - Barbaresi, Marco
AU  - Nardo, Davide
AU  - Fagioli, Sabrina
PY  - 2024
DA  - 2024/12/24
JO  - Brain Sciences
VL  - 15
IS  - 1
SP  - 3
