TI  - Effect of music intervention on anxiety in surgical patients: Systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials
AU  - Yu, Yang
AU  - Sabran, Kamal
AU  - Wang, Guoqing
AU  - Chen, Ziyue
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/01/13
