TI  - Beyond Performance: Cognitive Overload and Related Cognitive, Psychophysiological, and Performance States in Competitive Esports—A Scoping Review
AU  - Lachowicz, Maciej
AU  - Jamro, Dariusz
AU  - Zawadka, Anna
AU  - Tomala, Zofia
