TI  - Trajectories of Terminally Ill Patients' Cardiovascular Response to Receptive Music Therapy in Palliative Care
AU  - Warth, Marco
AU  - Kessler, Jens
AU  - Hillecke, Thomas K.
AU  - Bardenheuer, Hubert J.
PY  - 2016
DA  - 2016/04/15
