TI  - Efficacy of Virtual Reality Glasses on Anxiety, Physiologic Parameters, and Satisfaction Among High-Risk Pregnant Women Undergoing Nonstress Testing: A Quasi-Experimental Study
AU  - El-Kurdy, Rania
AU  - El-Ashry, Ayman Mohamed
AU  - Hassan, Samia I.
AU  - Samir, Khaled
AU  - Saber Ghaly, Asmaa
