TI  - Stress‐reducing effects of a brief mindfulness intervention in palliative care: Results from a randomised, crossover study
AU  - Warth, Marco
AU  - Koehler, Friederike
AU  - Aguilar‐Raab, Corina
AU  - Bardenheuer, Hubert J.
AU  - Ditzen, Beate
