TI  - Integrative Medicine Modalities for Adolescent Patients Undergoing Minimally Invasive Repair of Pectus Excavatum: A Scoping Review
AU  - Ramji, Jenna
AU  - Pawliuk, Colleen
AU  - Rowe, Jennifer
AU  - Baird, Robert
AU  - Ridgway, Randa
AU  - Görges, Matthias
AU  - Correll, Lynn R.
PY  - 2026
