TI  - Nature Scenes Counter Mental Fatigue-Induced Performance Decrements in Soccer Decision-Making
AU  - Sun, He
AU  - Soh, Kim Geok
AU  - Xu, Xiaowei
PY  - 2022
DA  - 2022/04/29
JO  - Frontiers in Psychology
VL  - 13
