TI  - Effectiveness of technology-based interventions compared with other non-pharmacological interventions for relieving procedural pain in hospitalized neonates: a systematic review
AU  - Palomaa, Anna-Kaija
AU  - Huhtala, Saija
AU  - Tuomikoski, Anna-Maria
AU  - Pölkki, Tarja
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/05/23
