TI  - Effectiveness of Musical Drama, Music Listening, and Tell‐Show‐Do Techniques on Reducing Dental Anxiety Among Orphaned Children Aged 12–15 Years—A Randomized Controlled Trial
AU  - KUPPUSAMY, KASTHURIPRIYA
AU  - Khawsar, Jannatul
AU  - Divvi, Anusha
AU  - JAIGANESH, SOBANA
AU  - Asokan, Vishnukumaran
