TI  - Effects of different art therapies on the psychological well-being and quality of life in cancer survivors: a systematic review and network meta-analysis
AU  - Wang, Qianlu
AU  - Tao, Yue
AU  - Huang, Ying
AU  - Huang, Bihong
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/07/06
