TI  - Effect of acupressure in the third eye point (EX-HN 3) on psychological distress, comfort and physiologic parameters among patients undergoing coronary angiography
AU  - Nadali, Javad
AU  - Ghiyasvandian, Shahrzad
AU  - Haghani, Shima
AU  - Mirhosseini, Seyedmohammad
AU  - Navidhamidi, Mojdeh
