TI  - Mind–body therapies for sleep disturbances, depression, and anxiety in menopausal women: a systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials
AU  - Fan, Zhixin
AU  - Zhang, Yifan
AU  - Shu, Yankai
AU  - Zhou, Yongxu
AU  - Zuo, Zhongzhi
PY  - 2025
