TI  - Integrating music and nature: a scoping review of research on interventions involving both music- and nature-based strategies for mental health and wellbeing
AU  - Hand, Michelle D.
AU  - Ihara, Emily S.
AU  - Moore, Morgan
AU  - Shaw, Madison
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/08/26
JO  - Frontiers in Human Neuroscience
VL  - 19
