TI  - Offering Outworld Experiences to In-Patients With Dementia Through Virtual Reality: Mixed Methods Study
AU  - Matsangidou, Maria
AU  - Solomou, Theodoros
AU  - Frangoudes, Fotos
AU  - Papayianni, Ersi
AU  - Pattichis, Constantinos S
PY  - 2023
